{
  "slug": "tula",
  "name": "Tula",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "LLM-native code quality, security, and documentation analysis tool. Scores projects on a 1000-point scale across five categories using YAML rules, static analysis tools, and semantic review for Python, JavaScript, TypeScript, Go, Java, C/C++ and Documentation repositories.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `tula` (Code quality, security, and documentation analyser).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install tula@claude-community` from `DaxGoon/tula`.\n\nCode quality, security, and documentation analysis using YAML rules, bash scripts, and LLM reasoning.",
